  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 草根Susan的舒适圈外生存指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652f46a351808d7e91b77fbd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652f46a351808d7e91b77fbd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Oct 2023 02:44:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>因为再一次地跨国搬家，以及忙着上EMBA的课，这期播客被我拖了两个月才剪辑完毕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>访谈对象Susan Zhang是我认识将近十年的好友，她从我们老家郑州，到澳大利亚上大学，进谷歌，调去伦敦，再回国加入字节跳动，再去读EMBA，现在又回到澳洲，一边在独角兽公司工作，一边在继续深造读博士。喜欢到处旅行的她去年也做了母亲，但这并未阻拦她继续探索舒适圈外的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2019年，她出版了一本她的自传：Life Outside My Comfort Zone: Hup draak!&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>购买链接：<a data-url="https://www.amazon.com/Life-Outside-My-Comfort-Zone/dp/1794103422" href="https://www.amazon.com/Life-Outside-My-Comfort-Zone/dp/1794103422">www.amazon.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>这些年她确实一直在践行“跳出舒适圈”的理念，一起来听听她的过往经历吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>附Susan博士期间发表的文章列表：<a data-url="https://scholar.google.com.au/citations?hl=en&amp;user=xIDlcxsAAAAJ" href="https://scholar.google.com.au/citations?hl=en&amp;user=xIDlcxsAAAAJ">scholar.google.com.au</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 走出国门来到澳洲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 进入悉尼谷歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 转战伦敦谷歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 加入字节回国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> 萌发去读EMBA的念头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> 又碰巧申请了个博士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">31:44</a> 博士方向：教育网红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 当妈后的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Steven Beddall - Endless Desert</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ntDnS17OGa-7DohhrX4qYheRBwM1.mp3" length="104767854" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnU2u7DS59oRzIJ4VqDMa72RqOvQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 清华学霸设计师的独立之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64915786932f350aaead04b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64915786932f350aaead04b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2023 07:38:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在清华读了本硕的韩璐曾在日本的无印良品工作过，回国后先后又在深圳和上海做过酒店设计和店铺设计。现在的她是一岁半男孩的妈妈，也是刚成立了自己工作室的独立设计师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目来听听学霸聊她的十年职场之路，以及现在独立自由状态下的她的日常。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 早期职业生涯&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 裸辞后做了些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 家庭财务平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a> 做独立设计咨询公司的初心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2819">46:59</a> 还会再回大公司上班吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3226">53:46</a> 分享自己的爱好和期望的生活方式&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Christopher Young - Kids</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lugo5Zx454w9cedFPl8njxPH0Z4-.m4a" length="117538147" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:51</itunes:duration>
